# Cloudflare static assets already serves clean URLs for real files
# (/legal -> legal.html) — adding rules for
# those collides with the auto .html handling and causes a redirect loop.
# Only the virtual /app alias (no app.html on disk) needs an explicit rewrite.
/app      /index.html   200
/editor   /index.html   200
# /gallery.html is a plausible guess for the reviewed gallery and was a dead
# end (no file, no redirect). Neither path is a real file, so no loop risk.
/gallery        /examples/gallery/   301
/gallery.html   /examples/gallery/   301
